# Keep the tree LF everywhere: packaged shebang scripts are executed directly on
# Unix hosts, and a CRLF checkout (core.autocrlf=true on Windows) breaks them with
# `/usr/bin/env: 'node\r': No such file or directory` before `pnpm pack` can run.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.webp binary
*.tgz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
